{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261DncMJUYMV1795486898.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價終止連續3天的升勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.7096，較上個交易日下調8點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價早段於6.67水平上落，離岸價於6.66徘徊。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展5,715億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠455億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:59:24.153709+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.436436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:52:45.948590+00:00","content_hash":"fc53889ad531b0568629999278dd27f50d9f94c48fb8c6fd2185f8433bedfb5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:59:24.153709+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}